vyges-lec checks gate-level netlists for logic equivalence (combinational and
sequential) and for properties, and reports counterexamples where they fail.

The released binary links the vyges-abc-lib archive, which carries ABC (The Regents
of the University of California, BSD-3-Clause style) and zlib (Zlib licence), and on
Linux the LLVM C++ runtime (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception). Their notices ship
beside the binary in NOTICE-abc and licenses-abc/.
